# Vox: Backspace on the big \ key, \ on the small Backspace key (the two swapped, as on HHKB keyboards).
# An overlay on the keyboard's usual layout: only these two keys change. Pick it in Android's settings: Physical
# keyboard > (the keyboard) > Vox: Backspace on the \ key. Linux key codes: 43 KEY_BACKSLASH, 14 KEY_BACKSPACE.
type OVERLAY

map key 43 DEL
map key 14 BACKSLASH
